--- Pasta (serves 4) ---
Ingredients:
  400 g spaghetti
  200 ml tomato sauce
  3 cloves garlic
  2 tbsp olive oil
Steps:
  1. Boil water and cook spaghetti
  2. Saute garlic in olive oil
  3. Add tomato sauce and simmer
  4. Combine and serve

--- Caesar Salad (serves 2) ---
Ingredients:
  1 head romaine lettuce
  100 g croutons
  50 g parmesan
  60 ml caesar dressing
Steps:
  1. Wash and chop lettuce
  2. Add croutons and parmesan
  3. Drizzle with dressing and toss

--- Tomato Soup (serves 6) ---
Ingredients:
  1000 g tomatoes
  1 large onion
  100 ml cream
Steps:
  1. Roast tomatoes and onion
  2. Blend until smooth
  3. Add cream and season

